  "priorExpiration": "2018-07-02",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Stra 1103.01 Eligible Programs. The office shall determine annual funding allocations for each eligible program. Eligible bachelor’s degree program shall be limited to 4 years. Eligible associate degree programs shall be limited to 2 years. Eligible career and certificate programs shall be limited to one year.\n\nSource. #12446, INTERIM, eff 1-3-18, EXPIRES: 7-2-18; ss by #12550, eff 6-19-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/stra1100.html"
